Z||000040||84fierotrevor||11-01-2001||01:59 PM||||Delorean !!!!!<BR>before i got my fiero <BR>i was going to purches a delorean from a man<BR>for 2500 dollers that car is better hen anything it sat way back in this corner behind the owenrs machine shop for about 7 years cuss when i was little i remember going back there and looking at it cus it was the back to the future time machine then one day i relized how awsome that car was and used to go back there every day with my friends and just look at it,<BR>then one day i asked the owner if i could buy it from him,he said yes 3000 dollers<BR>i said 2500 he said deal<BR>i stareted saving up every penny i could find and working extra hours and every day went back there and just looked at it checked every little thing out about it<BR>it was like it was magic, and adictive,<BR>and then one day i went back there and it was gone<BR>i asked the owner and he said he was talking to someone about it and the man was interetsed and said he would pay 300 bucks over my price if he could buy it right then,<BR>so the !@#$%^& SON OF A @#$% sold it to the ****er!  and the man that bought owns a outshop right next to my house and every time i drive to work he has it parked right out front completly restored and ****ing amazing looking !!!!!! and it shoulda been my car i lmost went nuts forever when he had sold my car it was my only chance in my life i would own that car and every day i spent day and days looking it up on the net<BR>and learning everything i could about it !<BR>and still tell this dayu and prolly for the rest of my life every time i see a delorean or hear the word i get all woozy inside deloreans are more then just a car,<BR>get a delorean. ask urself every time u see a mustang on the road do u get that same funny feeling u do when u see a delorean on tv ? let alone the road ? ah god i miss my delorean !!!!!!!! by the way does any one here know how to hotwire a delorean ???||||reg||1
